    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106602" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑλήεις</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσσα</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εν</span>, but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑλήεις</span> as fem. in <i><span class="en">
			Od.
			1.246
		</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑλήειν</span> as neut., <i><span class="en">
			Choerob.
			<u>in Theod.</u>
			2.214
		</span></i> H., cj. in <i><span class="en">
			Archil.
			74.9
		</span></i>; 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑλάεις</span></b>  (v. infr.): (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕλη</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>woody, wooded,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					17.748
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζάκυνθος, Νήϊον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.246
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				186
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρος, Ἴδη,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				484
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1010
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑλᾶεν πόντου πρόβλημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					1218
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀν᾽ ὑλάεντα νάπη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					1303
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλόος, ἀταρπὸς ὑ.,</span>
			<i>through the wood</i> or <i>dense growth,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antim.
				62
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				10.22
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Bianor</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>dwelling in the woods,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				9.524.21
			</span></i>.</div>
